        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees who are the subject of a formal Agency complaint or investigation shall be assured the following rights:",
            "block_bbox": [
                105,
                818,
                1116,
                866
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    105.0,
                    818.0
                ],
                [
                    1116.0,
                    818.0
                ],
                [
                    1116.0,
                    866.0
                ],
                [
                    105.0,
                    866.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. The employee shall not be deprived of any of the employee's constitutional or civil rights guaranteed by the federal and State Constitutions and Laws.",
            "block_bbox": [
                173,
                868,
                1115,
                918
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    173.0,
                    868.0
                ],
                [
                    1115.0,
                    868.0
                ],
                [
                    1115.0,
                    918.0
                ],
                [
                    173.0,
                    918.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. The employee shall be informed of the nature of the complaint or charges before the employee is required to respond to questions concerning the complaint or charges. Such interview shall normally occur during employee paid time.",
            "block_bbox": [
                173,
                919,
                1116,
                991
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    173.0,
                    919.0
                ],
                [
                    1116.0,
                    919.0
                ],
                [
                    1116.0,
                    991.0
                ],
                [
                    173.0,
                    991.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. If the employee is required to respond to a formal complaint or charge, the employee shall have the right to counsel and/or Union representation prior to and/or during the interview.",
            "block_bbox": [
                174,
                995,
                1117,
                1067
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 13,
            "group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    174.0,
                    995.0
                ],
                [
                    1117.0,
                    995.0
                ],
                [
                    1117.0,
                    1067.0
                ],
                [
                    174.0,
                    1067.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. The employee shall not be required to take or be subjected to any lie detector device as a condition of continued employment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                174,
                1070,
                1115,
                1119
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 14,
            "group_id": 13,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    174.0,
                    1070.0
                ],
                [
                    1115.0,
                    1070.0
                ],
                [
                    1115.0,
                    1119.0
                ],
                [
                    174.0,
                    1119.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. Formal complaints or charges made to an employee which are not verified or proven shall not be recorded and placed in the employee's personnel file or used in any subsequent performance evaluation.",
            "block_bbox": [
                174,
                1121,
                1117,
                1193
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 15,
            "group_id": 14,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    174.0,
                    1121.0
                ],
                [
                    1117.0,
                    1121.0
                ],
                [
                    1117.0,
                    1193.0
                ],
                [
                    174.0,
                    1193.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "f. The employee shall be notified verbally or in writing of the outcome of a formal investigation within fourteen (14) days after the completion of the investigation.",
            "block_bbox": [
